From: Joan Torres Lopez <joantolo@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Oct 2025 18:48:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/42] authPrompt: Let back button go back to step 1 instead
 of full reset

There can be some auth methods that would require multiple steps. In the
original behaviour when pressing back button, it would do a full reset
and display the user list. Now if we're in a multi-step flow (step > 1),
go back to step 1 instead of full reset.

Show backButton in unlockDialog for these cases.
